==Toons' Designations==
Within the [[Dandy's World]] lore each Toon has their own designation which fall into one of four known categories: L (Lead), OA (Operational Assistant), M (Main) and SC (Side Character). These designations give a rough estimated order of which Toons were created.

There is a total of 30 known designations, with 17 of them having a confirmed Toon designated to them and the other 13 currently have no known Toon designated to them.
