==Trivia==
*There are currently {{ToonAmount}} playable Toons, including {{ToonAmount|type=Event}} [[Holiday Toons]].
**There are currently {{ToonAmount|type=Non}} unobtainable Toons, making the total amount of Toons {{ToonAmount|type=All}}.
*All known Toons have an associated [[Twisted]].
*All [[Main Characters]] currently have no [[Introduction Cards]].
*All Toons have a total of 15 {{Star}}, split between their 5 [[stats]].
**All [[Main Characters]] have an additional star, bringing their total stars to 16 between their 5 stats.
**{{CI|Shrimpo|name=true}} is also an exception to this rule, as he's a challenge Toon. Shrimpo has a total of 5 stars, split between the 5 stats.
**{{CI|Dandy|name=true}} and {{CI|Dyle|name=true}} are also an exception to this rule, as they are developer/testing Toons. They have a total of 25 stars, split between the 5 stats.
*All female Toons have eyelashes while male Toons don't. This is usually the easiest way to distinguish them from one another.
**{{CI|Coal|name=true}} is an exception to this, as her eyes are 3D and eyelashes attached to her model would probably look odd.
*There are only three known scrapped Toons, being the [[Holiday Toons]] for the cancelled 2024 [[Halloween Event]], [[Countess]], [[Duke]], and [[Harvey]].
*It is currently unknown if the [[Holiday Toons]] use the SC and M designations or a unique one.

